+# BLUE CURRENT V48.10.0 — PILOT PROOF PROGRAM
+
+## V48.06–V48.10
+
+This wave converts the V48.5 Pilot Value Scorecard into a structured executive proof program.
+
+### V48.06 — Executive Success Criteria
+Success gates are committed before a commercial recommendation:
+- minimum overall score
+- minimum adoption score
+- minimum operating score
+- minimum value-evidence score
+- maximum high-attention locations
+
+### V48.07 — Per-Location Pilot Objectives
+Every authorized pilot location receives:
+- objective
+- accountable owner
+- readiness target
+- Manager Operating Rhythm target
+- modeled leakage-reduction target
+
+### V48.08 — Trend + Value Ledger
+The proof program presents baseline → checkpoint(s) → current state for:
+- readiness
+- operating rhythm
+- modeled leakage
+- verified realized value
+- overall score
+
+Verified value remains limited to measured completed-action outcomes.
+
+### V48.09 — Pilot Exceptions
+Locations enter the proof-program exception queue when:
+- operating attention is Watch/High/Critical, or
+- configured location targets are not currently satisfied.
+
+### V48.10 — Commercial Recommendation
+Blue Current produces one of four states:
+- CONFIGURE
+- INTERVENE
+- CONTINUE
+- EXPAND
+
+The recommendation is evaluated against the success gates committed by leadership. It never automatically expands a pilot.
+
+Policy:
+- `humanCommercialDecisionRequired: true`
+- `automaticExpansion: false`
+- `automaticAttribution: false`
+
+## Current authenticated integration result
+
+Against an isolated copy of the current Chefs runtime:
+- authorized locations: 5
+- proof program: active
+- current recommendation: INTERVENE
+- current exceptions: 5
+- verified realized value: $0
+- automatic expansion: false
+
+This is the correct conservative result immediately after establishing the pilot baseline and success criteria: there is not yet enough measured evidence to justify expansion.
+
+## API
+GET `/api/pilot-proof-program`
+
+POST `/api/pilot-proof-program/configure`
+
+## Validation
+- focused V48.10 proof-program test passed
+- success-criteria persistence passed
+- per-location objectives passed
+- trend construction passed
+- verified-value ledger passed
+- exception generation passed
+- EXPAND path passed under fully satisfied synthetic evidence
+- authenticated real-data lifecycle passed
+- real-data initial recommendation correctly returned INTERVENE
+- automatic expansion remained false
+- automatic attribution remained false
+- authoritative database unchanged
+- npm validation passed:
+  - 869 JavaScript files
+  - 738 client scripts
+  - 5,504 unique HTML ids
+
+## Next
+V48.11–V48.15 should build the Executive Pilot Review Packet: a decision-ready, exportable narrative that explains the baseline, progress, verified value, location exceptions, success-gate status, and the evidence behind the recommendation.
